  annotation = {TLDR: The transport and sedimentation of copper in the Glomma estuary, SE Norway during a period of 90\% reduction in the industrial input of Cu, was studied from sediment trap material and compared to samples of the bottom sediments, supporting the view that TOC is the main carrier of Cu to the sediments.\\
remark: Glomma's copper came from upriver industry and boats, but surprising hysteresis.},
