Citations: 11 (SemanticScholar) [2025-09-26]\\
TLDR: A mechanistic scaffold that supports a source-to-outcome structure and an associated workflow pipeline which facilitates needed data curation and transparency regarding operational assumptions is proposed and efficient use of data based on this scaffold across various modeling approaches will promote ``one health'' characterization.},
